IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. Main-Blocks-GetDefaultStateId-Oracle-TC-1.

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT RESULT-FILE ASSIGN TO WS-RESULT-FILE-PATH
        ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.

DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD RESULT-FILE.
01 RESULT-REC PIC X(80).

WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
    COPY DD-BLOCKS.
    01 EXPECTED-STATE-ID         BINARY-LONG.
    01 EXPECTED-STATE-ID-DISPLAY PIC 9(10).
    01 OUTPUT-LINE               PIC X(80) VALUE SPACES.
    01 WS-RESULT-FILE-PATH       PIC X(200).

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY "Main-Blocks-GetDefaultStateId-Oracle-TC-1 started".

    ACCEPT WS-RESULT-FILE-PATH FROM ENVIRONMENT "RESULT_FILE_PATH".

    MOVE BLOCK-ENTRY-DEFAULT-STATE-ID(1) TO EXPECTED-STATE-ID.

    OPEN OUTPUT RESULT-FILE.
    MOVE EXPECTED-STATE-ID TO EXPECTED-STATE-ID-DISPLAY.
    STRING "EXPECTED-STATE-ID=" DELIMITED BY SIZE
           EXPECTED-STATE-ID-DISPLAY DELIMITED BY SIZE
           INTO OUTPUT-LINE
    END-STRING.
    MOVE OUTPUT-LINE TO RESULT-REC.
    WRITE RESULT-REC.
    CLOSE RESULT-FILE.

    GOBACK.
END PROGRAM Main-Blocks-GetDefaultStateId-Oracle-TC-1.

